%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"    StudentID          Case          Objective    Solver     Curtailment_MWh    Loss_MWh    GridCost_Yuan    MaxConeGap    SimultaneousPower_MW    MinACVoltage    MaxACVoltage\n    _________    ________________    _________    _______    _______________    ________    _____________    __________    ____________________    ____________    ____________\n\n    2.424e+08    \"case_kaifaqu_A\"       \"C\"       \"mosek\"      -4.7867e-08      0.74287         20604        6.2892e-11             0                  0.95           1.0125   \n\n","truncated":false}}
